    <h1>Services</h1>
    <p class="muted">Availability: 12 PM–3 AM ET most days. Full details and ordering on Fiverr.</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="day">Game Server Setup</div>
        <p class="muted">Your server, installed, configured, and handed over running — not a pile of instructions.</p>
        <p><strong>$40 / $75 / $140</strong> tiers</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <div class="day">Remote IT Support</div>
        <p class="muted">10+ years of service desk and dispatch experience, applied to your machine, remotely.</p>
        <p><strong>$30 / $60 / $120</strong> tiers</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
